{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2021-08-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'NUCOR COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF HANNIBAL INDUSTRIES, INC.', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF HANNIBAL INDUSTRIES, INC., A LEADING NATIONAL PROVIDER OF STEEL RACKING SOLUTIONS, FOR A CASH PURCHASE PRICE OF $370 MILLION.'}